    "title": "Nacogdoches' Furniss plates 5 in Ole Miss win - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jeff Awtrey ,\n12 hours ago OXFORD, Miss. (KTRE) — Former Nacogdoches Dragon Will Furniss had a season-high five RBIs in Mississippi’s 17-6 win over UT Martin on Tuesday. Batting cleanup and starting at first base, the senior batted 2-for-4 with a double and a run. Furniss hit a three-run double in the second inning and a two-run single in the third inning. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
